    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσεμβολ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>intercalate</i> mean terms in a series, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.85
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>intercept</i> the influence of a planet, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				102.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.107
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Ptol.</u>
				188
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἥλιον -ῆσαι τοῖς ἑπτὰ
					κοσμοκράτορσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					341
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος πανταχοῦ
				μεμεσεμβόληται</span> ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
